# Streamerdesk ASMR Suite @SUITE_VERSION@ — Linux

**ES** · Seis filtros de audio para **OBS Studio 28 o posterior** pensados para ASMR, para **Linux x86_64** (Ubuntu, Linux Mint, Pop!_OS, Debian, Fedora, Arch, Manjaro, openSUSE…), también para **OBS Flatpak**. Gratis y de código abierto, hecho con cariño por Streamerdesk — https://streamerdesk.com

**EN** · Six audio filters for **OBS Studio 28 or later**, made for ASMR, for **Linux x86_64** (Ubuntu, Linux Mint, Pop!_OS, Debian, Fedora, Arch, Manjaro, openSUSE…), **Flatpak OBS** included. Free and open source, lovingly made by Streamerdesk — https://streamerdesk.com

